  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strengthening Democratic Resilience in Moldova (EDMITE III) project represents a critical intervention to fortify the democratic consolidation in the Republic of Moldova against a backdrop of significant internal and external challenges. These challenges include cyber operations, information operations, illicit political financing, and efforts to delegitimize democratic processes and institutions. The project, developed in response to the 2024 UN Electoral Assistance Needs Assessment Missi</narrative>
  </description>
